{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本偶像女團NMB48的25歲舊將上西伶，出名與家姐上西惠感情好。她因受到家姐影響加入組合，前年離隊單飛後，更拍住家姐一齊影寫真搵食。</p><p>2027年將至，兩姊妹首度以姊妹檔，合體推出月曆吸金，齊齊以比堅尼上陣大晒身材，又穿上日式浴衣，展示一年四季的不同美態，實行365日陪住粉絲。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.719446+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T01:37:13.881871+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:18.004726+00:00","content_hash":"58721be183036027b852f6a28f1052b44e47b1e526ce0c70be7fb751b0dd3b3a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.719446+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}